          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESie m\u00F6chten mehr erfahren oder direkt in Kontakt treten?\u003Cbr\u003EDann schreiben Sie mir per Post:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDirk Seefeld\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/strong\u003EHoherade 18\u003Cbr\u003ED-20257 Hamburg\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003ESocial Links:\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://patreon.com/iDSeefeld?utm_medium=unknown\u0026amp;utm_source=join_link\u0026amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator\u0026amp;utm_content=copyLink\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 title=\u0022Patreon-Profil\u0022 data-anchor=\u0022?utm_medium=unknown\u0026amp;utm_source=join_link\u0026amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator\u0026amp;utm_content=copyLink\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EPatreon-Profil\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
